yaml/mapping/flow
description: Pairs comma-separated inside curly braces
- >
  The flow concrete: the pairs ride comma-separated inside curly braces. It is a SUPERCLASS of
  [json/object](*::language:concretes:07-json_code:00-json_structured:00-json_object) -
  every JSON object parses as a flow mapping, while YAML also lets keys and values ride plain:
- !!<format: text/x-yaml> |
  julia: {age: 42, pets: [cat, scorpion]}
- *..:..:..:..:..:07-json_code:00-json_structured:00-json_object
